# Sparkle: the version project.yml pins exactly, and the archive of that release
# whose bin/ holds generate_appcast, sign_update and generate_keys. lib.sh's
# sparkle_tools refuses an archive with another sha256. Checked against GitHub's own digest of the
# release asset on 2026-10-03. To move: change all three, and project.yml's exactVersion.
SPARKLE_VERSION=2.10.0
SPARKLE_URL=https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/releases/download/2.10.0/Sparkle-2.10.0.tar.xz
SPARKLE_SHA256=c2bf58aa8387266ac179357b1415d6f2635f044da8be41042af32425dae6da0c
